---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/about.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Meet Antonio" description="Meet Antonio, your Amazon guide, and discover how Águia Amazonas works with the local community to create authentic journeys." alternateEn="/about/" alternatePt="/pt/sobre/">
  <section class="page-hero wrap">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Rooted here</p><h1>The Amazon<br/>is personal.</h1></div>
    <p>Águia Amazonas is Antonio, your guide to the Amazon. He works closely with the local community to offer authentic, respectful experiences shaped by a lifetime of local knowledge.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="story-grid wrap">
    <div class="story-image story-guide-card"><img src="/images/people/antonio-guide-card-improved.png" width="1176" height="1338" alt="Antonio’s official Cadastur tourism guide card" /><span>Antonio<br/>Founder · Guide · Host</span></div>
    <div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow light">Meet your host</p><h2>Welcome to my home.</h2><p>“Welcome to Brazil and the Amazon rainforest—my home and workplace throughout my life. I am here to welcome you, your family and friends to discover this wonderful place on Earth.”</p><p>“Whether your stay is short or long, tell us what matters to you and we can personalise your visit so that you make the most of your time with us.”</p><p class="signature">Antonio</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="credential-section wrap" aria-labelledby="credential-title">
    <div class="credential-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Qualified to guide</p>
      <h2 id="credential-title">Officially registered.<br/>Locally experienced.</h2>
      <p>Antonio is a registered regional tourism guide in Amazonas through Brazil’s Ministry of Tourism and Cadastur. He guides in Portuguese and English, combining professional credentials with a lifetime of knowledge rooted in the forest.</p>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Category</dt><dd>Regional Guide · Amazonas</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd>Portuguese · English</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Credential valid until</dt><dd>29 July 2031</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <figure class="credential-image">
      <img src="/images/people/antonio-cadastur-certificate.jpg" width="1754" height="1241" alt="Antonio’s official Cadastur certificate issued by Brazil’s Ministry of Tourism" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <figcaption>Official certificate · Brazil’s Ministry of Tourism · Cadastur</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
